WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.950
"Who's Mother?" Perda asked.

2
00:00:02.951 --> 00:00:07.176
"Come with us." The oldest girl blew at Zann and Darb.

3
00:00:07.177 --> 00:00:09.979
Zann felt his feet lifting off the ground.

4
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.376
He struggled against the spell, but it was no use.

5
00:00:13.377 --> 00:00:18.224
"You can't do this!" Gliss protested. "It's kidnapping!"

6
00:00:18.225 --> 00:00:25.599
The girls giggled. "Come, cute dragon!" a younger girl cooed at Zing, who bounded along happily.

7
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.050
"You'd better stop or else!" Perda warned.

8
00:00:29.051 --> 00:00:33.164
"We must show Mother," the oldest girl said calmly.

9
00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:36.813
"Halt!" Perda cried, rubbing her hands together.

10
00:00:36.814 --> 00:00:40.529
Zann watched magic energy zip toward him and Darb.

11
00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:43.339
The tallest girl puffed out a breath.

12
00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:46.922
Bang ! Perda's spell exploded and fizzled

13
00:00:46.923 --> 00:00:51.921
out. "Whoa." Perda sounded impressed. "How'd you do

14
00:00:51.922 --> 00:00:55.800
that?" "Come," the oldest girl said. "Let's find

15
00:00:55.801 --> 00:00:59.634
Mother." The girls walked away, with the boys floating beside

16
00:00:59.635 --> 00:01:03.434
them. "We shouldn't let them out of sight," Gliss told

17
00:01:03.435 --> 00:01:07.232
Perda. Zann felt powerless as he drifted through the

18
00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:11.609
forest. Finally the whole group stopped at the base of an enormous

19
00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:15.469
tree. "Here we are," a girl said.

20
00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:20.023
"Home." She blew toward the ground and floated upward. So did her

21
00:01:20.024 --> 00:01:27.027
friends. Zann felt himself rise beside them, as Darb rose helplessly too. Zing flew

22
00:01:27.028 --> 00:01:30.447
along. "Wait!" Perda cried. "What about

23
00:01:30.448 --> 00:01:33.855
us?" "We'd better levitate." Gliss sounded

24
00:01:33.856 --> 00:01:36.823
nervous. "How high do you think they're

25
00:01:36.824 --> 00:01:41.988
going?" "We'll bring you," the oldest girl said. "With your

26
00:01:41.989 --> 00:01:47.804
permission." Perda looked uncertain. "Um, okay. You have our

27
00:01:47.805 --> 00:01:53.444
permission." Soon Perda and Gliss were floating too. Perda ended up beside

28
00:01:53.445 --> 00:01:56.074
Zann. "Are you okay?" she

29
00:01:56.075 --> 00:01:59.490
asked. He couldn't answer. He couldn't even nod his

30
00:01:59.491 --> 00:02:06.459
head. They floated up to a large, elaborate house built into the treetops. The girls led the way

31
00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:11.065
inside. "Mother!" the youngest cried. "Look what we

32
00:02:11.066 --> 00:02:18.779
found!" A woman looked up. She had green hair and skin like the girls, but her face was wrinkled and

33
00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:27.482
wise. "Ah, visitors," she said. "Have my girls immobilized you? My deepest

34
00:02:27.483 --> 00:02:31.347
apologies." She puffed out a breath, and Zann felt the spell

35
00:02:31.348 --> 00:02:36.378
dissipate. "Be careful, Mother!" a girl said. "They were trying to

36
00:02:36.379 --> 00:02:43.119
escape." Mother smiled. "Sit down, girls, and listen quietly while I talk with our

37
00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:46.651
visitors. This will be a learning opportunity for

38
00:02:46.652 --> 00:02:51.038
you." The girls sat down, watching with wide, curious

39
00:02:51.039 --> 00:02:56.048
eyes. "One thing they should do is learn not to immobilize people," Zann

40
00:02:56.049 --> 00:03:07.706
grumbled. Mother chuckled. "Please forgive my girls. They've never left Zon, so they've never seen a male before. There are none

41
00:03:07.707 --> 00:03:13.020
here." "What about you?" Perda asked. "You don't seem surprised to see

42
00:03:13.021 --> 00:03:17.896
boys." "I traveled to many other worlds in my youth," Mother

43
00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:23.242
explained. "Can we keep them?" one of the girls asked. "I've always wanted a

44
00:03:23.243 --> 00:03:30.767
pet!" Mother smiled. "That wouldn't be right," she explained gently. "Boys are people

45
00:03:30.768 --> 00:03:36.139
too." "Oh!" The girl looked disappointed. "If you say so,

46
00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:39.649
Mother." Zann wanted to get away from these strange

47
00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:44.992
females. "We refuse to be held prisoner!" he declared, trying to sound tough.

48
00:03:44.993 --> 00:03:50.511
"You're not prisoners," Mother said. "You're free to leave at any time."

49
00:03:50.512 --> 00:03:54.861
"Good." Zann stomped toward the door. "Come on, guys."

50
00:03:54.862 --> 00:04:02.585
"Wait," Gliss said. "Mother seems to—to know things. Maybe she can help us."

51
00:04:02.586 --> 00:04:08.595
Zann hesitated. He still wanted to leave this place, but he realized Gliss was right.

52
00:04:08.596 --> 00:04:15.337
Mother seemed wise, and it was obvious that the people in this world had very strong magic.

53
00:04:15.338 --> 00:04:20.621
"Please stay," Mother urged. "At least for a little while.

54
00:04:20.622 --> 00:04:25.531
My girls rarely get the opportunity to learn from strangers."

55
00:04:25.532 --> 00:04:30.606
"Yes," a girl said. "We'd love to hear about your world."

56
00:04:30.607 --> 00:04:37.910
"All right." Zann sat down. "We come from Magica, and we're looking for my parents . . ."

57
00:04:37.911 --> 00:04:41.720
With help from his friends, he told the whole story.

58
00:04:41.721 --> 00:04:48.530
". . . So we're checking every world with blue skies that we see," Zann finished. "That's how we landed here."

59
00:04:48.531 --> 00:04:54.112
Mother laughed heartily. "Oh, I'm sorry to laugh!" she exclaimed.

60
00:04:54.113 --> 00:04:59.016
"But there are more worlds out there than you can possibly imagine.

61
00:04:59.017 --> 00:05:03.747
Many of them—perhaps most—have blue skies.

62
00:05:03.748 --> 00:05:08.331
You could get lucky and find World X on your next try.

63
00:05:08.332 --> 00:05:12.459
Or you could spend the rest of your lives searching in vain."

64
00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:15.839
Zann frowned. "We have to try!"

65
00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:17.933
Mother smiled sympathetically.

66
00:05:17.934 --> 00:05:22.034
"I admire your spirit. Perhaps I can help.

67
00:05:22.035 --> 00:05:26.425
Do you have anything that belongs to the people you're seeking?"

68
00:05:26.426 --> 00:05:30.715
Zann pulled out his message stone. "This came from my parents."

69
00:05:30.716 --> 00:05:34.842
"Good." Mother leaned closer, blowing on the stone.

70
00:05:34.843 --> 00:05:39.924
"There. Now it should lead you straight to its rightful owners."

71
00:05:39.925 --> 00:05:44.095
"Really?" Zann said. "It'll take us to my parents?"

72
00:05:44.096 --> 00:05:48.040
"The spell never fails." Mother sounded confident.

73
00:05:48.041 --> 00:05:55.094
She turned to the girls. "Say good-bye to our visitors, girls. They must continue their quest."

74
00:05:55.095 --> 00:06:00.222
"Do they have to go?" a girl cried. "We want to hear more stories!"

75
00:06:00.223 --> 00:06:02.868
"Maybe another time," Perda said.

76
00:06:02.869 --> 00:06:05.915
Darb peered out a window. "How do we get down?

77
00:06:05.916 --> 00:06:08.327
And how will we find the wormhole?"

78
00:06:08.328 --> 00:06:13.845
"I can help with that too." Mother blew the door open. "Ready?"

79
00:06:13.846 --> 00:06:18.386
Zann and his friends nodded. "Come on, Zing," said Zann.

80
00:06:18.387 --> 00:06:21.496
Zing seemed reluctant to leave his new friends.

81
00:06:21.497 --> 00:06:26.115
But after more pats and kisses from the girls, he finally came to Zann.

82
00:06:26.116 --> 00:06:30.223
"Farewell and good luck." Mother blew at them.

83
00:06:30.224 --> 00:06:33.545
This time Zann didn't feel trapped by the spell.

84
00:06:33.546 --> 00:06:40.746
Mother's breath carried them gently but swiftly to the ground, through the forest, and finally to the wormhole.

85
00:06:40.747 --> 00:06:45.474
"Wow, that was weird," Perda said as they landed.

86
00:06:45.475 --> 00:06:50.559
"Yeah," Zann said. "But it worked out for the best, didn't it?"

87
00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:54.146
He reached into his pocket and touched his message stone.

88
00:06:54.147 --> 00:06:57.468
Would Mother's spell really lead him to his parents?

89
00:06:57.469 --> 00:07:02.308
Zann and his friends re-shackled themselves and then jumped through the wormhole.

90
00:07:02.309 --> 00:07:06.832
Zann gasped as the message stone suddenly yanked him forward.

91
00:07:06.833 --> 00:07:11.685
"It's working!" he cried.

